Description: DTK sender that mirrors the screen to Miracast displays
 A DTK6 desktop app that discovers Wi-Fi Display sinks over
 NetworkManager P2P, completes WFD/RTSP, and streams the selected
 X11 monitor as H.264 (optional AAC) over RTP.
 .
 Wayland capture is stubbed until a ScreenCast portal is available.
 Do not treat this as universal sink support.
